# The media root when the server runs on a laptop, anchored to the one path it
# is ever at. Unanchored, `media/` also matched `src/Aspire.Infrastructure/Media/`
# on a case-insensitive checkout, and that source directory silently never
# reached git — the VPS found out by failing to compile.
/src/Aspire.Api/media/
